                            | Traveling: I have been solo traveling on a budget for a good chunk of the past 3 years. I have explored dozens of countries, focusing on the history, culture, food, and nature of each place. Some highlights include running the Athens Marathon in Greece, completing the Everest Base Camp + 3 Passes trek in Nepal, attended the 2022 World cup in Qatar, going to two Indian weddings, seeing five World Wonders (the Colosseum, Chichén Itzá, Machu Picchu, Petra, and the Taj Mahal), celebrated Holi in India and the Songkran in Thailand, among many other things. The adventure has truly been a whirlwind.
